From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jcode patch catalog <jcode@localhost>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 22:07:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: remove promotional onboarding content

X-Jcode-Patch-Intent: Remove hosted subscription promotions, sales pitches, and upgrade nudges from onboarding flows.
X-Jcode-Patch-Kind: personal-feature
X-Jcode-Patch-Depends-On: 1008-personal-feature-remove-hosted-subscription-and-promotional-commands.patch

Patch intent:
Remove hosted subscription promotions, sales pitches, and upgrade nudges from
onboarding flows and their tests.

Why it exists:
This personal build must not promote hosted services during onboarding. New
users should land in a normal session without commercial encouragement.

Upstream integration points:
The patch relies on TUI onboarding rendering, onboarding flow control, and
onboarding simulation and golden tests.

Update guidance:
Keep onboarding free of hosted service promotions and upgrade nudges while
retaining provider configuration and import reviews.

Validation:
scripts/cargo_exec.sh check -p jcode-tui
scripts/cargo_exec.sh test -p jcode-tui onboarding_import_summary_does_not_expose_telemetry --lib
